{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q309533","formula":"C₁₁H₁₉NO₁₀","hill":"C11H19NO10","elements":["H","C","N","O"],"composition":{"C":11.0,"H":19.0,"N":1.0,"O":10.0},"names":{"en":"N-glycoloyl-beta-neuraminic acid","ru":"N-Гликолилнейраминовая кислота"},"descriptions":{"en":"N-Glycolylneuraminic acid (Neu5Gc) is a sialic acid molecule found in most non-human mammals. Humans cannot synthesize Neu5Gc because the human gene CMAH is irreversibly mutated, though it is found in other apes. The gene CMAH encodes CMP-N-acetylneuraminic acid hydroxylase, which is the enzyme responsible for CMP-Neu5Gc from CMP-N-acetylneuraminic (CMP-Neu5Ac) acid.","ru":"N-гликолилнейраминовая кислота (Neu5Gc) — представляет собой N-производное нейраминовой кислоты, которая найдена у большинства млекопитающих, в то время как организм человека не может синтезировать её из-за отсутствия гена CMAH (отвечает за синтез кислоты), однако он встречается у обезьян. Neu5Gc относится к сиаловым кислотам."},"fame":13,"pubchemCid":123802,"mass":325.27,"charge":0,"smiles":"C1[C@@H]([C@H]([C@@H](O[C@@]1(C(=O)O)O)[C@@H]([C@@H](CO)O)O)NC(=O)CO)O","inchikey":"FDJKUWYYUZCUJX-AJKRCSPLSA-N","iupac":"(2S,4S,5R,6R)-2,4-dihydroxy-5-[(2-hydroxyacetyl)amino]-6-[(1R,2R)-1,2,3-trihydroxypropyl]oxane-2-carboxylic acid","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"123802","atoms":41,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":-1.473,"y":0.034,"z":0.193,"el":"O"},{"x":0.907,"y":-3.345,"z":0.152,"el":"O"},{"x":0.501,"y":1.425,"z":1.603,"el":"O"},{"x":-2.435,"y":-1.116,"z":-1.649,"el":"O"},{"x":-0.797,"y":2.79,"z":-1.536,"el":"O"},{"x":-4.126,"y":-2.29,"z":0.094,"el":"O"},{"x":-1.043,"y":5.097,"z":-0.051,"el":"O"},{"x":-3.821,"y":-0.327,"z":1.213,"el":"O"},{"x":3.328,"y":-0.68,"z":1.346,"el":"O"},{"x":5.63,"y":-0.4,"z":-0.021,"el":"O"},{